            "selectCount": 1,
            "bodyHtml": "<p>Complete the form below. Write <strong>ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p><div><div><strong>Booking a residential workshop</strong></div><ul><li><strong>Course required:</strong> drama workshop</li><li><strong>Full name of participant:</strong> Jan {{1}}</li><li><strong>Previous course attended:</strong> Writing for the {{2}}</li><li><strong>Address:</strong> 20, Gregory {{3}}</li><li><strong>Current occupation:</strong> {{4}}</li><li><strong>Date chosen course begins:</strong> {{5}}</li><li><strong>Estimated arrival time:</strong> {{6}} pm</li><li><strong>Special dietary requests:</strong> no {{7}} products</li><li><strong>Preferred afternoon course:</strong> {{8}} work</li><li><strong>First source of course information:</strong> {{9}}</li><li><strong>Pre-course material requested:</strong> the {{10}} mentioned in the publicity</li></ul></div>",
